                    considered (102.1/1–1047).</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d844-f2" n="8" xml:id="d844-f2-content">
                <p>Export-Import Bank of Washington.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d844-f3" n="9" xml:id="d844-f3-content">
                <p>United Nations Relief and Rehabilitation Administration.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d844-f4" n="10" xml:id="d844-f4-content">
                <p>For correspondence on post-UNRRA grants to China, see <ref target="#pg1293">pp.
                        1293</ref> ff.</p>
            </note>
